  id: 7
  title: the Spark of Zaun
  role: Marksman
  passiveName: Living Battery
  passiveDescription: 'Walking and Burst Fire charge your Sparkpack (the coils on your gun glow brighter). B fires a battery shot at the enemy you aim at: a full charge adds damage based on max health, and any shot executes an enemy it leaves low (its ring turns red).'
  patch: 16.19.1
  portrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1f4441a0c36286041a8c73bd01b28046, type: 3}
  passiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: b2b0d50d8e152884b92d12dc066d1347, type: 3}
  spells:
  - name: Burst Fire
    vrDescription: 'Right trigger: seven rounds from your gun at the first enemy where it points (sweep it to spray); hold to keep firing. Overcharged: three fast rounds that chain lightning.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 756294ce8db76d740bdb39f7325ba26f, type: 3}
