  - name: Ultrashock Laser
    vrDescription: 'X: hold until your left palm crackles, then release to fire a pulse where it points. It slows the first enemy; a pulse that hits a wall becomes a long laser through it. A quick tap cancels.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c9387668c92d3743b4673782f99e71b, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 12
