    - 70
  - name: Lightning Crash
    vrDescription: 'Left trigger: hold, then release to discharge a lightning nova around you (a quick tap cancels). Hitting an enemy Overcharges you: faster attacks and movement, and Burst Fire chains lightning.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e197cd51005201446b12b967a9a9e9fe, type: 3}
